  "title": "Garlic Brussels Sprouts with Crispy Bacon",
  "description": "Pan-fry Brussels sprouts in butter and crispy bacon for a smoky addition to your vegetable side dish. You can add a little of the bacon grease to the dish if you prefer.",
  "authors": [
